        </a>
        <a href="/contact" style="background: transparent; color: #2D6A4F; padding: 0.6rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 6px; border: 2px solid #2D6A4F; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;">
          Ask a Question →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
